  Description: Prerequisite Region - Absalom and Starstone Isle You spent years working
    as a clerk to a functionary in Absalom's government. Your service taught you
    a thing or two about rousing speeches and manipulating the city's bureaucracy.
    Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Charisma or Intelligence , and one
    is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Government
    Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Group Impression]
    skill feat.
